checking if file is in recent files | Invalid line range validation happens 
AFTER the early return for "file not in recent files" |\n| Users should get 
accurate error messages about invalid parameters | Users get misleading error 
messages that don\'t help them fix their request |\n\n## Root Cause\nThe 
`should_read_file` method has this order of operations:\n1. **Lines 547-567**: 
